<title>ITALY: Arafat arrives for brief visit to Italy.</title>
<headline>Arafat arrives for brief visit to Italy.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palestinian President Yasser Arafat arrived in Rome on Thursday for a one-day visit which will include a meeting with Pope John Paul.</p>
<p>Arafat, who arrived at the city's Ciampino Airport, went directly to the Vatican for his audience with the Pope.</p>
<p>He was later due to meet Italian President Oscar Luigi Scalfaro, Prime Minister Romano Prodi and Foreign Minister Lamberto Dini.</p>
</text>
